{"version":1,"content":"<p>英偉達發佈GeForce Hotfix 621.35驅動程序，其基於最新的GeForce Game Ready 621.24 WHQL驅動程序基礎上。自從基於Blackwell架構的GeForce RTX 50系列顯卡發佈後，英偉達頻繁地發佈Hotfix驅動程序，先後發佈了13次，其中有7次是在今年。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587396.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T11:43:53.601453+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":156,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T11:19:33+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T11:37:11.146073+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T11:37:11.146073+00:00","content_hash":"a054a94cf0646d555d20dcf0f0cb01ce3b6048315e24a54cb4145458a5974a3f","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}